  "description": "Yoon-woo, an actor known mostly for bit parts, finally lands a lead role in a famous director’s next feature! The only problem? He’s starring opposite Nam Jihyuk - his a-list ex-lover. As Yoon-woo becomes more invested in his role, he finds himself unable to parse fantasy from reality: is Jihyuk's flirtatious behavior and passion him trying to win Yoon-woo back? Or he is simply acting the part? As the two struggle to reconcile their past issues, will they be able to find paradise again in one another's embrace? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes an April Fools Day Special and Halloween Special.*",
